{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16992","headline":"途次 · 武元衡","name":"途次","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"去国策羸马，劳歌行路难。\n地崇秦制险，人乐汉恩宽。\n御沼澄泉碧，宫梨拂露丹。\n鼎成仙驭远，龙化宿云残。\n不问三苗宠，谁陪万国欢。\n至今松桂色，长助玉楼寒。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"武元衡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_16992.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16992","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}